---
import PageLayout from "@layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout>
  <section>
    <p>Full-Stack Software Developer.</p>

    <p>
      I help organizations build web applications, digital service systems,
      operational dashboards, and system integrations that are secure, easy to
      use, and dependable over the long term.
    </p>
    <p>
      As a full-stack developer, I am used to being involved from the beginning
      of the process: understanding requirements, designing workflows, building
      the backend and frontend, setting up databases, handling deployment, and
      making sure the application can be monitored, secured, and maintained
      after launch.
    </p>
    <p>
      My focus is not just on building applications that work, but on creating
      systems that genuinely support how organizations operate: cleaner
      processes, easier data management, faster access to services, and
      operations that are easier to monitor.
    </p>
    <p>
      I have experience working on a range of information systems and digital
      services, including licensing systems, early warning systems for disaster
      risks, organizational portals, single sign-on, knowledge centers, HR
      systems, internal tools, uptime monitoring, and web applications tailored
      to specific needs.
    </p>
    <p>
      If your organization needs an web applications, an operational dashboard,
      a digital service system, an application integration, or system
      monitoring, I can help design and build it from the initial requirements
      to a production-ready release.
    </p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
